{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple 2D action puzzle game that conveys waves to lead you to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of scaffolding blocks that can be shaken like waves to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 14 worlds with 10 stages per world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control a square character. The stage is cleared when the goal is touched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scaffolding in each stage consists of blocks that can be shaken like waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using the waves, it is possible to reach places that are out of reach of ordinary jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of the various properties of the waves is the key to solving the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/extras/eff5b46595d9624b7a18749febde11de.poster.avif?t=1764255653\" width=450 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/extras/eff5b46595d9624b7a18749febde11de.webm?t=1764255653\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578960/extras/eff5b46595d9624b7a18749febde11de.mp4?t=1764255653\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various gimmicks on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gimmicks may interfere with the player or may be necessary to conquer the stage.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3578960/0dd6cabb179687cae23326801fb289fc044714fc.jpg"},{"name":"Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/35789